        <Literal datatypeIRI="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">CTD Profile Data from the Great Lakes&lt;br/&gt;&lt;p&gt;CTD profile data&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Acquisition Description:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;p&gt;CTD casts were conducted during R/V Blue Heron cruises at designated stations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Processing Description:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;p&gt;CTD profile data&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br/&gt;</Literal>
