&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bco-dmo.org/dataset/686700&quot;&gt;Scup and windowpane flounder expanded lengths&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br/&gt;</Literal>
    </DataPropertyAssertion>
