        <DataProperty IRI="#hasAbstract"/>
        <NamedIndividual IRI="http://lod.bco-dmo.org/geolink/id/dataset/674381"/>
        <Literal datatypeIRI="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">SERC nutrients&lt;br/&gt;&lt;p&gt;This dataset contains nutrient data from Molasses Reef, Florida Keys National Marine Sanctuary from 2009-2011. Samples were analyzed at the SERC&amp;nbsp;Nutrient Analysis Lab (Southeast Environmental Research Center) at Florida International University.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Natural history of the study site:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
These data were collected at Molasses Reef (25.017, -80.3674), near Pickles Reef.&lt;/p&gt;

