        <Literal datatypeIRI="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">Relative abundance of phyla&lt;br/&gt;&lt;p&gt;This dataset contains relative abundance data of phyla for the study plots at Pickles Reef, Florida Keys National Marine Sanctuary from 2009-2013.&lt;/p&gt;

