        <IRI>#weakCoReferentOf</IRI>
        <Literal datatypeIRI="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#PlainLiteral">Used to state that an instance matches with another based on a totally loose, machine-generated matching. The matching only needs at least one important property matches.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
